I can do it though.

01:23:01.920 --> 01:23:06.380
Thank you.

01:23:35.720 --> 01:23:38.560
Dad, please, just stop! Just stop!

01:24:10.610 --> 01:24:17.000
And now, my dear friend, I'd like to dedicate this song to all of you out there.

01:24:17.580 --> 01:24:22.230
Wherever you may be, this song is for you.

01:25:36.100 --> 01:25:48.900
You're sitting on the floor being weird. That's normal. So you're good, right?

01:25:49.450 --> 01:25:53.220
Because when the power went out, then maybe you're messing with that dark realm shit again.

01:25:55.230 --> 01:25:58.910
I know that you don't really care for the dark, so I figured

01:26:01.020 --> 01:26:04.100
would illuminate your room, much like how I illuminate your life.

01:26:04.640 --> 01:26:06.450
I'm not afraid of the dark anymore.

01:26:08.100 --> 01:26:08.280
Okay.

01:26:08.830 --> 01:26:12.350
Well, I hauled these all the way down here, so they're going up anyway.

01:26:13.840 --> 01:26:15.160
You know, they're totally freaking annoying.

01:26:18.680 --> 01:26:25.450
So, um, listen, I got your text, and I wrote a snarky response,

01:26:25.550 --> 01:26:28.270
and then I deleted it because Grandma Perky always told me

01:26:28.270 --> 01:26:29.810
to never escalate an argument over text.

01:26:30.380 --> 01:26:41.760
Doesn't convey tone, but I mean if you want my opinion here it is don't go digging around in your past

01:26:41.760 --> 01:26:50.530
Some things are just better left buried you know and sometimes you just have to move on

01:27:01.210 --> 01:27:01.630
Dalton?

01:27:37.830 --> 01:27:39.890
Hey.

01:28:01.660 --> 01:28:02.160
I'll do it.

01:28:03.004 --> 01:28:04.004
You okay?

01:30:03.420 --> 01:30:05.020
We're going to get out of here and we're going to get home, okay?

01:30:05.916 --> 01:30:06.796
We're never going to be there.

01:30:38.828 --> 01:30:39.668
I'm here and there.

01:30:44.012 --> 01:30:45.012
I know you're in there.

01:30:45.932 --> 01:30:48.012
But if you touch me again, I'm gonna fuck you up.

01:31:01.948 --> 01:31:02.448
Oh!

01:31:17.948 --> 01:31:18.188
Amen.

01:31:21.660 --> 01:31:22.860
They can possess our bodies.

01:31:23.200 --> 01:31:25.160
It happened to me, and now he's done it to you.

01:31:31.468 --> 01:31:32.068
We've got to go.

01:32:51.050 --> 01:32:51.130
That's right.

01:33:05.340 --> 01:33:10.590
I'm going to block it, I'm going to seal it.

01:33:11.150 --> 01:33:20.060
Dad, please.

01:33:30.510 --> 01:33:30.850
You go.

01:34:00.600 --> 01:34:00.740
No!

01:35:00.990 --> 01:35:01.070
Thank you.

01:36:15.000 --> 01:36:15.960
You need to get rid of that thing.

01:36:16.370 --> 01:36:17.410
Burn it. Forget about it.

01:36:17.590 --> 01:36:19.220
No, forgetting it doesn't work.

01:36:19.820 --> 01:36:22.610
We need to remember even the things that hurt.

01:38:31.280 --> 01:38:33.570
Okay, he's okay, okay

01:39:16.480 --> 01:39:20.040
see you next Friday. Tell Foster to pack his history

01:39:20.040 --> 01:39:24.020
homework up. You come a little earlier if you want.

01:39:24.160 --> 01:39:27.470
Join us for dinner. I'd like that.

01:39:28.010 --> 01:39:28.230
Thanks.

01:39:51.630 --> 01:39:52.430
Lovely home.

01:39:52.610 --> 01:39:53.690
Oh, thanks.

01:39:54.050 --> 01:39:55.550
Do you live here?

01:39:55.770 --> 01:39:56.630
I hope so.

01:39:56.810 --> 01:39:58.980
That's a weird answer.

01:40:00.320 --> 01:40:01.600
Guess I'm just lost in memories.

01:40:01.820 --> 01:40:04.450
They can flood the mind.

01:40:04.670 --> 01:40:13.380
I know you.

01:40:16.810 --> 01:40:17.790
You may have seen me around.

01:40:19.290 --> 01:40:20.090
I know your mother.

01:40:25.500 --> 01:40:26.800
There's so much I want to tell her.

01:40:28.170 --> 01:40:28.670
I know.

01:40:30.000 --> 01:40:33.740
And you can, and you will, someday.

01:40:35.250 --> 01:40:38.600
You have a bright future ahead, you and Dalton.

01:40:42.710 --> 01:40:44.110
Keep a steady stride, Josh.

01:42:06.970 --> 01:42:07.530
I made the wall.

01:42:30.000 --> 01:42:44.560
It is where DRA-

01:43:30.160 --> 01:43:36.720
A stove there can be
